# Kulan OS: dracut, the start-up image maker signed start-up (and TPM
# unlock) use, kept in the ISO's package pool for Kulan Installer. It
# conflicts with initramfs-tools and live-tools, which the live system and
# installer.list.binary have, so it has a list of its own: live-build
# downloads each list separately.
dracut
systemd-cryptsetup
